Major DP Patterns:

1D DP
Fibonacci
Climbing Stairs
Frog Jump

2D / Grid DP
Unique Paths
Minimum Path Sum

DP on Subsequences
Knapsack
Subset Sum
Coin Change

DP on Strings
LCS
Edit Distance
Wildcard Matching

DP on Stocks
Buy and Sell Stock series

LIS Pattern
Longest Increasing Subsequence
Bitonic Sequence

Partition DP
Matrix Chain Multiplication
Burst Balloons

DP on Trees
House Robber III
Diameter of Tree

DP on Graphs
Longest Path in DAG
Path Counting

Bitmask DP
Travelling Salesman Problem

Digit DP (advanced)
Count numbers with conditions

Interval DP
Often overlaps with Partition DP

State Machine DP
Transaction/state transition problems

Probability DP
Probability-based transitions

Game DP / Minimax DP
Stone Game
Optimal play problems